Description: INT8 inference engine for AMD Strix Halo NPU
 1bit.systems is a pure native inference stack for the AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395.
 It runs Qwen3-0.6B at 243 ms/tok on the XDNA 2 NPU with 4 concurrent contexts.
 .
 Zero Python at runtime. One C++23 binary.
